            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اس دودھ میں پانی کی ملاوٹ ہے۔ is dūdh meṅ pānī kī milāvaṭ hai. This milk has been watered down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ملاوٹ (milāvaṭ) is built on ملانا, \"to mix\", from Sanskrit milati, \"meets\" (CDIAL 10133), with the noun ending -āvaṭ: in a shop it means something cheaper mixed in."
            }
          ]
        },
